{
  "title": "Quietly Simmered Ethiopian Collard Greens Gomen",
  "description": "A traditional Ethiopian dish featuring pre-fried teque os and yakimono-grill, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients, served in a ceramic tagine, this gomen is a perfect lazy-sunday meal.",
