      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "optional"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saute for another minute.",
    "Add the chopped collard greens and saute until they start to wilt.",
    "Add the pre-fried teque os, yakimono-grill sauce, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the red wine, if using, and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the gomen simmer quietly for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the gomen hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
  ],
